Type: DocumentPreviewProps exported from '@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar-documentpreview/client' ✓ (imported by office exactly like that). Need that as a dev+peer dep? It's a type-only import → tsc needs the package resolvable. Check our package.json deps — we have dsh-client-ui-sidebar-documentpreview in peer/dev already ✓ (inject list includes it).

