pnpm add: `cd packages/plugins/plate && pnpm add --save-peer --save-dev ...`? plate pattern: deps in both peerDependencies and devDependencies. Existing entries mirror each other. pnpm add with both flags: `pnpm add -D -P pkg@ver`? Hmm — pnpm `add -D --save-peer` saves to both? Not sure it supports both simultaneously in one flag set. Two commands: `pnpm add --save-peer pkg@ver` then `pnpm add -D pkg@ver`. That's how it presumably was done for @platejs/media (it's in dependencies only — runtime import). For @deepseek-ai UI packages they're peer+dev (type-only + runtime-provided). 

