This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.

Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:

   - **Standing (from earlier sessions)**: 「我不需要你二开platedAI UI，我需要你保持它原生的UI，包括编辑器」 — keep Plate's official native UI, no self-made UI. Plus: office plugin zero changes; push only via one-off `git@github.com:kenlinwei001-a11y/dshwork.git` (never modify the remote); frontend access via `127.0.0.1` not `localhost`; all shell vars in `${VAR}` braces; build/pack/`plugin add` must share one command with the `cd`; after every plugin add re-verify the dsh-mcp-connector `sidebarVisible=false` patch (`grep -c` must be 1); rebuild dist before restarting; `dsh plugin add` must carry `DSH_HOME=<runtime home>`; never echo the live workdsh session token to stdout (credential-materialization rule — a permission denial explicitly instructed reading the token only via file redirection); no restarting background services without user notice; confirm before development work.
   - **This session, in order**:
